# 2025考研英语红宝书-核心短语
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 考研英语
# 来源: 2025考研英语红宝书词汇
# 描述: 考研英语高频核心短语

{{知识点1}}{{account for 解释；说明；占（比例）
【例句】Coal accounts for 70% of the country's energy production.
【搭配】account for a large proportion of 占…很大比例
【辨析】account for（说明原因/占比）vs explain（解释理由）vs make up（组成）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点2}}{{as a result 因此；结果
【例句】He didn't study hard. As a result, he failed the exam.
【搭配】as a result of 由于；因为
【辨析】as a result（因此，句首）vs consequently（正式，句首/句中）vs therefore（因此，正式）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点3}}{{be bound to 一定会；必然
【例句】She is bound to succeed with such determination.
【搭配】be bound to do sth 一定会做某事
【辨析】be bound to（必然）vs be sure to（一定会）vs be certain to（确定会）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点4}}{{be supposed to 应该；被期望
【例句】You are supposed to submit the report by Friday.
【搭配】be supposed to do sth 应该做某事
【辨析】be supposed to（按规则应做）vs should（建议/义务）vs ought to（道义上应该）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点5}}{{by means of 通过；借助
【例句】They solved the problem by means of technology.
【搭配】by no means 决不；by all means 当然可以
【辨析】by means of（借助手段）vs by way of（经由）vs by virtue of（凭借）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点6}}{{call for 要求；需要；呼吁
【例句】The situation calls for immediate action.
【搭配】call for sb 去接某人；call for sth 需要/要求某事
【辨析】call for（需要/呼吁）vs ask for（请求）vs demand（强烈要求）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解核心短语}}

{{知识点7}}{{come up with 提出；想出
【例句】The team came up with a creative solution.
【搭配】come up with a plan/an idea/a solution 提出计划/想法/解决方案
【辨析】come up with（想出）vs think of（想到）vs put forward（正式提出）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读写作高频短语}}

{{知识点8}}{{consist of 由…组成
【例句】The committee consists of ten members.
【搭配】consist in 在于；consist with 与…一致
【辨析】consist of（无被动）vs be composed of（正式）vs be made up of（口语）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点9}}{{contribute to 有助于；促成；导致
【例句】Regular exercise contributes to good health.
【搭配】contribute significantly to 对…有重大贡献
【辨析】contribute to（促成）vs lead to（导致）vs result in（引起）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解核心短语}}

{{知识点10}}{{correspond to 相当于；与…对应
【例句】The British 'pub' corresponds to the American 'bar'.
【搭配】correspond with 与…通信；与…相符
【辨析】correspond to（对应）vs correspond with（与…一致/通信）vs match（匹配）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点11}}{{depend on 依靠；取决于
【例句】Success depends on hard work and perseverance.
【搭配】depend on sb to do sth 依靠某人做某事；depend on it that... 取决于…
【辨析】depend on（取决于）vs rely on（信赖）vs count on（指望）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点12}}{{dispose of 处理；清除；解决
【例句】The company must dispose of its waste properly.
【搭配】dispose of waste/rubbish 处理废物/垃圾
【辨析】dispose of（正式处理）vs get rid of（摆脱）vs deal with（处理）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点13}}{{draw on 利用；依赖；临近
【例句】The author draws on personal experience in her novels.
【搭配】draw on one's experience/knowledge 利用经验/知识
【辨析】draw on（利用经验）vs rely on（依赖）vs resort to（诉诸）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点14}}{{dwell on 详述；老是想着
【例句】Don't dwell on past failures; focus on the future.
【搭配】dwell on the details 详述细节；dwell on the past 沉溺于过去
【辨析】dwell on（详细讨论/纠结）vs elaborate on（详细阐述）vs linger on（徘徊不去）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点15}}{{for the sake of 为了；为了…的利益
【例句】She moved to the city for the sake of her children's education.
【搭配】for the sake of convenience 为了方便；for God's/goodness' sake 看在上帝的份上
【辨析】for the sake of（为了…的利益）vs for the purpose of（为了…目的）vs in order to（为了）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点16}}{{give rise to 引起；导致
【例句】The new policy gave rise to widespread debate.
【搭配】give rise to controversy/problems/changes 引起争议/问题/变化
【辨析】give rise to（引起，较正式）vs lead to（导致）vs cause（造成）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解核心短语}}

{{知识点17}}{{hand in hand 密切相关；手拉手
【例句】Economic growth and environmental protection should go hand in hand.
【搭配】go hand in hand 密切相关；hand in hand with 与…密切相关
【辨析】hand in hand（密切相关）vs closely related（紧密相关）vs intertwined（交织）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点18}}{{have access to 有权使用；可以接近
【例句】All students have access to the library resources.
【搭配】have free/unlimited access to 免费/无限制使用
【辨析】have access to（有途径使用）vs reach（到达）vs approach（接近）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点19}}{{hold back 阻止；抑制；隐瞒
【例句】She held back her tears during the speech.
【搭配】hold back information 隐瞒信息；hold back one's anger 抑制怒火
【辨析】hold back（阻止/抑制）vs prevent（阻止发生）vs restrain（约束）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点20}}{{in accordance with 依照；根据
【例句】The work was done in accordance with the instructions.
【搭配】in accordance with the law/regulations 根据法律/规定
【辨析】in accordance with（正式遵照）vs according to（据…所说）vs in line with（与…一致）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点21}}{{in case 以防；万一
【例句】Take an umbrella in case it rains.
【搭配】in case of 如果发生；just in case 以防万一；in any case 无论如何
【辨析】in case（以防）vs in the event of（万一发生）vs lest（以免，正式）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点22}}{{in contrast 相比之下；与之对比
【例句】The north is cold. In contrast, the south is warm.
【搭配】in contrast to/with 与…形成对比
【辨析】in contrast（对比差异）vs on the contrary（正相反）vs by contrast（对比之下）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点23}}{{in favor of 支持；赞成
【例句】The majority voted in favor of the proposal.
【搭配】be in favor of 支持；do sb a favor 帮某人忙
【辨析】in favor of（支持）vs in support of（支持）vs on behalf of（代表）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点24}}{{in terms of 在…方面；就…而言
【例句】In terms of quality, this product is the best.
【搭配】in terms of money/time/effort 在金钱/时间/精力方面
【辨析】in terms of（就…而言）vs with regard to（关于）vs concerning（关于）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读写作高频短语}}

{{知识点25}}{{keep pace with 与…并驾齐驱；跟上
【例句】Technology must keep pace with changing demands.
【搭配】keep pace with the times 跟上时代步伐
【辨析】keep pace with（跟上步伐）vs catch up with（赶上）vs keep up with（保持同步）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点26}}{{lay off 解雇；停止做
【例句】The factory laid off 200 workers last month.
【搭配】lay off employees 解雇员工；lay off doing sth 停止做某事
【辨析】lay off（暂时/永久解雇）vs fire（开除）vs dismiss（解雇，正式）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点27}}{{make sense 有意义；讲得通
【例句】His explanation doesn't make sense at all.
【搭配】make sense of 理解；弄懂；it makes sense to do sth 做某事是合理的
【辨析】make sense（有意义）vs be reasonable（合理）vs be logical（合乎逻辑）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点28}}{{on behalf of 代表；为了…的利益
【例句】I am writing on behalf of my company.
【搭配】on behalf of sb/sth 代表某人/某组织
【辨析】on behalf of（代表）vs for the sake of（为了…的利益）vs in the name of（以…的名义）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读写作高频短语}}

{{知识点29}}{{on the basis of 以…为根据
【例句】The decision was made on the basis of scientific evidence.
【搭配】on the basis of facts/evidence 以事实/证据为依据
【辨析】on the basis of（根据）vs based on（基于）vs on the grounds of（以…为理由）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点30}}{{other than 除了；不同于
【例句】There's nobody here other than me.
【搭配】none other than 不是别人正是；no other than 只有
【辨析】other than（除了）vs except（除…之外）vs apart from（除…外还）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点31}}{{pick up 拾起；学会；好转；接人
【例句】She picked up French while living in Paris.
【搭配】pick up speed 加速；pick up on 注意到；pick oneself up 重新振作
【辨析】pick up（顺便学会）vs learn（系统学习）vs acquire（习得）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点32}}{{prior to 在…之前
【例句】Prior to the meeting, please read the report.
【搭配】prior to this 在此之前；prior to doing sth 在做某事之前
【辨析】prior to（正式，之前）vs before（之前）vs ahead of（提前）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读写作高频短语}}

{{知识点33}}{{put forward 提出；推荐
【例句】The committee put forward a new proposal.
【搭配】put forward a theory/plan/suggestion 提出理论/计划/建议
【辨析】put forward（正式提出）vs come up with（想出）vs propose（提议）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点34}}{{refer to 提到；参考；指的是
【例句】The term 'AI' refers to artificial intelligence.
【搭配】refer to...as 把…称为；refer to a dictionary 查字典
【辨析】refer to（提及/参考）vs mention（提到）vs allude to（暗示）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解核心短语}}

{{知识点35}}{{result in 导致；造成
【例句】The accident resulted in three deaths.
【搭配】result in success/failure/disaster 导致成功/失败/灾难
【辨析】result in（导致）vs result from（由…造成）vs lead to（导致）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解核心短语}}

{{知识点36}}{{rule out 排除；不考虑
【例句】The police ruled out suicide as a cause of death.
【搭配】rule out the possibility of 排除…的可能性
【辨析】rule out（排除可能）vs eliminate（消除）vs exclude（排除在外）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点37}}{{set aside 留出；不理会；撤销
【例句】She sets aside an hour each day for reading.
【搭配】set aside money/time 留出钱/时间；set aside differences 搁置分歧
【辨析】set aside（留出/搁置）vs put aside（储蓄）vs reserve（保留）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点38}}{{take...into account/consideration 考虑到；顾及
【例句】You should take all factors into account before making a decision.
【搭配】take...into account 考虑到；take account of 注意到
【辨析】take...into account（全面考虑）vs consider（考虑）vs bear in mind（记住）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读写作高频短语}}

{{知识点39}}{{take over 接管；接替
【例句】She will take over the company next month.
【搭配】take over from sb 接替某人；take over control 接管控制
【辨析】take over（接管）vs take charge of（负责）vs assume control（承担控制）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点40}}{{turn out 结果是；原来是；生产
【例句】The experiment turned out to be a great success.
【搭配】turn out to be 结果是；as it turned out 事实上
【辨析】turn out（结果是）vs prove to be（证明是）vs end up（最终成为）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点41}}{{with regard to 关于；至于
【例句】With regard to your question, here is my answer.
【搭配】with regard to this issue 关于这个问题
【辨析】with regard to（关于）vs regarding（关于）vs as for（至于）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读写作常考短语}}

{{知识点42}}{{work out 解决；锻炼；算出；想出
【例句】We need to work out a plan as soon as possible.
【搭配】work out a problem 解决问题；work out in the gym 在健身房锻炼
【辨析】work out（解决/算出）vs figure out（弄清楚）vs solve（解答）
【词频】★★★★★ 全题型高频短语}}

{{知识点43}}{{cope with 应对；处理
【例句】She learned to cope with stress through meditation.
【搭配】cope with difficulties/pressure 应对困难/压力
【辨析】cope with（成功应对）vs deal with（处理）vs handle（操控）
【词频】★★★★★ 阅读理解高频短语}}

{{知识点44}}{{interfere with 干扰；妨碍
【例句】Loud noise interferes with my concentration.
【搭配】interfere with sb's plans/work 干扰某人的计划/工作
【辨析】interfere with（妨碍）vs intervene in（介入）vs interrupt（打断）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}

{{知识点45}}{{amount to 合计；相当于；意味着
【例句】His debts amount to over $100,000.
【搭配】amount to nothing/a lot 一无所成/意义重大
【辨析】amount to（合计/相当于）vs add up to（合计）vs total（总计）
【词频】★★★★☆ 阅读理解常考短语}}
